# Build-fork ignore list. Binaries never belong in a build repo: decks, documents,
# spreadsheets, PDFs and images are added to Appian by hand in Designer and kept
# out of git (see reference/toolchain.md §8). MCP registration is per machine.
*.pptx
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.pdf
*.png
*.jpg
.mcp.json
uploads/
scratch/
# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store

# Kiro: MCP registration and permissions are per machine and live in ~/.kiro/settings/
# (GETTING_STARTED.md §1, step g). A workspace mcp.json would also launch in cloud sessions.
.kiro/settings/
# Hook state and logs written by .kiro/scripts/ (closeout counter, hook-events.log).
.kiro/state/
# Python bytecode from the hook scripts
__pycache__/
